      "role": "user",
      "content": "here is the diff for the main changes in #442:\n\n```diff\n--- a/dependencies/framework.json\n+++ b/dependencies/framework.json\n@@ -12,7 +12,6 @@\n- \"agent-core\": \"v2.4.1\",\n- \"agent-runtime-engine\": \"v2.4.1\",\n+ \"stateless-executor\": \"v1.0.0\",\n \"scheduler\": \"v3.1.0\",\n \"logger\": \"v1.2.0\"\n```\n\nit basically replaces the whole `agent-core` and `agent-runtime-engine` with that `stateless-executor` thing to save on compute. the plan is to decommission the agentic loop entirely once this is merged. what do u think of the dependency swap?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
